@host = http://localhost:8080

# F2 회원·회원권 등록 — API-1 · API-2
# seed(03 §9): 지점 1·2 / 회원 1(지점 1 기간제 ACTIVE) · 2(횟수제 ACTIVE) · 3(EXPIRED만) · 4(지점 2 ACTIVE)
# 시작일은 실행일(2026-09-17) 기준으로 고정한다
# 도달하지 않는 에러
# - MEMBER_INVALID_INPUT: 공백 이름 · 형식 오류 연락처는 Request 검증(COMMON_INVALID_INPUT)이 먼저 막는다 — 도메인 테스트 TC-2-12로 확인
# - MEMBER_PHONE_DUPLICATED: F7(선택) 구현 시에만
# - PAUSED 보유 회원 재등록(TC-2-09): 정지 API가 F4라 여기서 만들 수 없다 — API 테스트로 확인

### [TC-2-01] 이름 · 연락처로 회원 등록
# @expect 201
# @expect $.name == "정하늘"
# @expect $.phone == "010-9000-0001"
# @db SELECT COUNT(*) FROM member WHERE phone = '010-9000-0001' => 1
POST {{host}}/api/members
Content-Type: application/json
X-Branch-Id: 1

{ "name": "정하늘", "phone": "010-9000-0001" }

### [TC-2-02] 기간제 회원권 등록 (3개월)
# @uses memberId = [TC-2-01].$.memberId
# @expect 201
# @expect $.type == "PERIOD"
# @expect $.status == "ACTIVE"
# @expect $.branchId == 1
# @expect $.endDate == "2026-12-17"
# @expect $.remainingCount == null
# @db SELECT COUNT(*) FROM membership WHERE member_id = {{memberId}} AND status = 'ACTIVE' AND months = 3 => 1
# @db SELECT COUNT(*) FROM membership_history WHERE member_id = {{memberId}} AND event_type = 'REGISTERED' => 1
POST {{host}}/api/memberships
Content-Type: application/json
X-Branch-Id: 1

{ "memberId": {{memberId}}, "type": "PERIOD", "startDate": "2026-09-17", "months": 3, "paymentAmount": 300000 }

### [TC-2-13] 기간제인데 months 없음 → 400
# @expect 400
# @expect $.errorCode == "MEMBERSHIP_INVALID_INPUT"
# @db SELECT COUNT(*) FROM membership WHERE member_id = 3 => 1
POST {{host}}/api/memberships
Content-Type: application/json
X-Branch-Id: 1

{ "memberId": 3, "type": "PERIOD", "startDate": "2026-09-17", "paymentAmount": 300000 }

### [TC-2-04] 횟수제 회원권 등록 — EXPIRED만 가진 회원 3, 종료일 = 시작일 + 6개월
# @expect 201
# @expect $.type == "COUNT"
# @expect $.status == "ACTIVE"
# @expect $.endDate == "2027-03-17"
# @expect $.remainingCount == 10
# @db SELECT COUNT(*) FROM membership WHERE member_id = 3 AND status = 'ACTIVE' AND remaining_count = 10 AND months = 6 => 1
POST {{host}}/api/memberships
Content-Type: application/json
X-Branch-Id: 1

{ "memberId": 3, "type": "COUNT", "startDate": "2026-09-17", "count": 10, "paymentAmount": 150000 }

### [TC-2-05] 유효 회원권 보유 회원(seed 회원 1)에 재등록 → 409
# @expect 409
# @expect $.errorCode == "MEMBERSHIP_ALREADY_ACTIVE"
# @db SELECT COUNT(*) FROM membership WHERE member_id = 1 => 1
POST {{host}}/api/memberships
Content-Type: application/json
X-Branch-Id: 1

{ "memberId": 1, "type": "PERIOD", "startDate": "2026-09-17", "months": 1, "paymentAmount": 100000 }

### [TC-2-18] 다른 지점(2)의 유효 회원권을 가진 회원 4에 지점 1에서 등록 → 409
# @expect 409
# @expect $.errorCode == "MEMBERSHIP_ALREADY_ACTIVE"
# @db SELECT COUNT(*) FROM membership WHERE member_id = 4 => 1
POST {{host}}/api/memberships
Content-Type: application/json
X-Branch-Id: 1

{ "memberId": 4, "type": "PERIOD", "startDate": "2026-09-17", "months": 1, "paymentAmount": 100000 }

