### [TC-1-03-형식] X-Branch-Id 숫자 아님 → 400
# @expect 400
# @expect $.errorCode == "COMMON_INVALID_INPUT"
POST {{host}}/api/memberships
Content-Type: application/json
X-Branch-Id: abc

{ "memberId": 3, "type": "PERIOD", "startDate": "2026-09-17", "months": 1, "paymentAmount": 100000 }

